a3b446ce7e70))(text "470pF is at the RHD pin; 10M bleeds the internal node. Switch capacitance/leakage/injection and shared reference mismatch remain modeled assumptions." (at 20.32 371.475 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left)) (uuid b62c685d-2fd1-50ae-a8a8-176a32ec2c5f))(text "Fault threshold follows +/-5V rails and is far outside RHD +/-0.4V linear DC range. External low-voltage qualification is mandatory before unclamping." (at 20.32 379.095 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left)) (uuid 04d37b2a-2477-5f2b-8857-65c39f264946)))
